Dependencies: SDD

Purpose:
  Define the dependency graph engine of the .sdd system — how
  dependencies are represented, validated, and evaluated. Root-level
  reusable system intelligence; concrete project graphs live in
  projects/{project_name}/dependencies/.

Owns: ./

Components:
  graph: dependency graph model (DAG, nodes, edges, types, cycle detection,
    topological sort, readiness, failure propagation)

  locking: resource locking model (pessimistic/optimistic locks, leases,
    timeouts, deadlock detection, lock recovery)

Files:
  graph: @graph.sdd
  locking: @locking.sdd

Navigation:
  Graph: @graph.sdd
  Locking: @locking.sdd
  ProjectDependencies: @projects/{project_name}/dependencies/INDEX.sdd

State: +